    "text": "1 days ago A new statue will replace the state Capitol’s iconic copper “Montana” as part of an extensive renovation of the building’s exterior, according to state officials. Montana Free Press recently reported on the ongoing renovations to the Capitol building, including work on its copper dome and the expected refurbishment of the statue atop the building. Read full article\n1",
